<title>MALAYSIA: PSC shares suspended from trading.</title>
<headline>PSC shares suspended from trading.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Malaysian shipbuilder PSC Industries Bhd were voluntarily suspended from Thursday trading.</p>
<p>The company in a statement to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange late on Wednesday asked for an immediate suspension of its stock, without giving any reason.</p>
<p>The company's stock closed Wednesday trading at 31.75 ringgit.</p>
</text>
